+    <p>Catavan is an unofficial fork of Kdenlive that changes how the timeline and the monitors behave to get close to
+      the editing workflow of VEGAS Pro: a separate action cursor during playback, Auto Ripple, automatic crossfades
+      when clips overlap, adjustable playback speed in the monitors with WSOLA time stretching, and more.</p>
+    <p>Each change can be turned off in the settings, which brings back the original Kdenlive behavior. Projects are
+      regular Kdenlive projects.</p>
+    <p>Catavan is not affiliated with or endorsed by KDE, the Kdenlive project or VEGAS Creative Software.</p>
